	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas, quas misisti, accepi 1. novembris die, datas <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ante 16 dies, in quibus petis libellos <placeName ref="l303">Magdenburgi</placeName> excusos; scias <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>apud nos nunc temporis nullos inveniri; si ante mensem accepissem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>literas, potuissem emere.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Si autem meos vis legere, libenter commu<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nicabo, sed ea lege, ut bona fide remittas; nolo enim illis carere <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>propter certas causas.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Puto autem iam actum esse de <placeName ref="l303">Magdenburgensibus</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>qui obsessi sunt cum quatuor exercitibus, <placeName ref="l1041">Brunsvicensi</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1048">Branden<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>burgensi</placeName>, <placeName>Mechlinensi</placeName> et Mauriciano, et fama spargit <persName ref="p18250">Mauritium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>occupasse <placeName ref="l303">Magdenburgum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Videbimus mirabilia opera dei.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Saepe cogito <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName>, qui amissis optimis viris mox se dediderunt in turpiss<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>imam servitutem, e qua nunquam liberabuntur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Sic fortassis <placeName ref="l303">Magden<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>burgi</placeName> contigit; amissis optimis viris domi mansere hypocritę, qui <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>iam urbem in potestatem Caesaris dare iucundo animo constituerunt.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Verum certiora brevi audiemus.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l2510">Turca</placeName> in maximo apparatu est <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>et cogitat <placeName ref="l921">Moraviam</placeName> devastare et <placeName ref="l746">Vratislavienses</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">die Breslauer.</note> in maximo sunt <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>timore et reliquę civitates <placeName ref="l2449">Bohemicę</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Dominus fortassis ita vult <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>suam ecclesiam defendere ab istis vulpinis hominibus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>omnes fere nationes <placeName ref="l2536">Europę</placeName> depopulata est et iam etiam crines <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>dabit hostibus exteris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Quid in <placeName ref="l691">Lotharingia</placeName> acciderit cum ossibus <persName>Caroli</persName> ducis <placeName ref="l631">Burgun<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>dię</placeName> sepulti in <placeName ref="l956">Nansę</placeName>, absque dubio melius nosti quam ego.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Sic <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>solet <persName>Caesar</persName> effringere sepulchra, epitaphia destruere et nescio <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quid crudele in mortuos designare per suos legatos.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Bellum absque <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>dubio ingens illud factum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Galli enim passim apud nos pecuniam <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>coronatis commutant, pecunias multas habent apud se; unde autem <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>habeant, ignoro.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Timeo, ne d. <persName ref="p2916">Schertlinus</persName> eiiciatur ex urbe nostra, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>homo dignus, ut diu servetur apud nos.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Sed nolo hac de re <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>scribere, quum mihi certę causę non sint cognitę, cur id fiat <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>vel an futurum sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, 18. novembris 1550.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Hie schickt myn hußfrow uwernn mit eynem gruͦß <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ein par messer zuͦ eim meskram, bittet sy, sy welle <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>verguͦtt nemen mit einen kleynen gabe etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">G[ast<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Doctissimo viro m<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>agistro <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> pastori vi<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>gilantissimo et<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>c.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
